First, a vertex is represented as v = {f1, f2, f3, f4, f5}. Among them, f1-f5 represent the one-hot encoding vector of atom type, atom degree, atom implicit valence and atom aromatic respectively. Then the characteristics of each drug H = {v1, v2, v3…, vn} are obtained.1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
