				\begin{document}$$h_{i}^{\left( 0 \right)} = one - hot\left( {Featuer} \right)$$\end{document}hi0=one-hotFeatuer

After initializing the node features, update the node features through the attention mechanism of GATv2:2\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
