				\begin{document}$$h_{i}^{(1)} = \sigma \left( {\sum\limits_{j \in N\left( i \right)} {\alpha_{ij}^{\left( 1 \right)}{W}^{\left( 1 \right)} h_{j}^{\left( 0 \right)} } } \right)$$\end{document}hi(1)=σ∑j∈Niαij1W1hj0

The attention coefficient αij(1) is calculated in the following way:3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
